&lt;div&gt;We are looking for a Designated Support Engineer III to join our team in a hybrid capacity based in Bangalore, reporting to the Manager, Global Focal Support within our Support department. You will function as the highest level of technical support within the TAC, responsible for resolving the most complex and critical issues escalated from Level I and Level II support engineers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
