&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a proven ability to leverage AI technologies and workflows to drive measurable operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior knowledge of Forward Proxy and cloud environments like AWS and Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience working in Firewall and VPN/Zero Trust environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
