&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of network security concepts and technologies (SSL/TLS, VPNs, Firewall, IDS/IPS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of VPN technologies, including IPsec and various VPN clients&lt;/li&gt;
