&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Manager, Investor Relations &amp;amp; Strategic Finance to join our team. This is a Remote role, reporting to the Senior Manager, Investor Relations &amp;amp; Strategic Finance in the Investor Relations &amp;amp; Strategic Finance department. In this critical position, you will drive key investor relations projects and play a pivotal role in our quarterly earnings processes. You will also lead high-impact strategic finance initiatives that support our long-term growth, competitive positioning, and operational success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do (Role Expectations)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support the quarterly earnings process, including the preparation of earnings press releases, call scripts, financial outlooks, Q&amp;amp;A documents, and accompanying work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform financial, strategic, and competitive analyses, including industry and peer benchmarking, market/valuation trends, and ad-hoc projects to support strategic initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build models and leverage data analysis to understand complex relationships, identify and synthesize key trends, and gain insight into critical metrics, drivers, and scalability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate on the execution of our annual Investor Day and investor sessions at customer conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support high-impact corporate development and strategic finance initiatives, including M&amp;amp;A due diligence and long-range planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are (Success Profile)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a relentless problem-solver who is energized by finding solutions and tackling hard challenges to deliver the greatest impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You embody a true growth mindset, continuously seeking feedback and developing yourself to become a stronger partner and purposeful teammate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate with urgency and a bias for action, balancing speed and quality to rapidly deliver high-impact results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are driven by innovation and curiosity, constantly seeking better, more scalable ways to accelerate transformation and solve complex challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are highly data-driven, leveraging analytics and evidence to guide informed decisions and measure what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking for (Minimum Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of relevant experience combining Investment Banking or Sell-Side Research with in-house Investor Relations at a high-growth, public SaaS or enterprise software company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Master&#39;s degree in Finance, Economics, Mathematics, or a related quantitative field, coupled with a strong interest in equity market operations and stock drivers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong financial modeling skills and advanced valuation depth, with the capability to confidently discuss valuation frameworks for M&amp;amp;A and due diligence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundational understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience leveraging, securing, or positioning AI-driven solutions to optimize outcomes within your functional domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Will Make You Stand Out (Preferred Qualifications)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of cybersecurity architectures, cloud infrastructure, and subscription-based financial models&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Foundational to advanced understanding of AI/ML technologies and experience positioning AI-driven product pipelines, as well as utilizing modern analytics tools to optimize IR workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chartered Financial Analyst (CFA) certification&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
